          "$-\\dfrac{8}{15} + \\dfrac{7}{10} = -\\dfrac{16}{30} + \\dfrac{21}{30} = \\dfrac{-16 + 21}{30} = \\dfrac{1}{6}$ ."
        ],
        "result": "A = \\dfrac{1}{6}"
